𒑰 DUB.SAR 1.0 Example: First Tablet
𒑰 Difficulty: Beginner
𒑰 Concept: Tablet Structure & Quantity Establishment
𒑰 Mode: Tablet (Canonical Cuneiform)
𒑰
𒑰 Purpose:
𒑰   Demonstrates minimal canonical tablet structure: declaring a problem section,
𒑰   establishing physical quantities with units, computing field area via postfix
𒑰   multiplication, and inscribing the resulting quantity.
𒑰
𒑰 Expected Output:
𒑰   1200 length^2

